      "created": null,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "From v1: two routes around one central hall.\nHere: several regions compete for attention,\nwith lateral links so taking A, B or C\nchanges the next push.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "From v1: two routes around one central hall.\nHere: several regions compete for attention,\nwith lateral links so taking A, B or C\nchanges the next push.",
