      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "A  Safer territory and higher ground,\n    but a longer path toward JEV.\n\nB  Valuable centre, reachable by both\n    sides; hard to hold without flanks.\n\nC  Longer expansion path, but opens\n    a different approach to the enemy.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A  Safer territory and higher ground,\n    but a longer path toward JEV.\n\nB  Valuable centre, reachable by both\n    sides; hard to hold without flanks.\n\nC  Longer expansion path, but opens\n    a different approach to the enemy.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
